{"text":"그레이브본이에요!","source_cn":"是亡灵！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0C691EF1E835C55D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그레이브본이에요!","female":"그레이브본이에요!","variant_male_record_index":"134451","variant_female_record_index":"134452","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1220354015:1":{"text":"그 무서운 사람이 제 흉터를 치료해 줄 수 있다고 했어요.","source_cn":"那个可怕的人说，能帮我治好身上的疤痕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43E80EB8271FA860","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1220354016:1":{"text":"그러면서 며칠에 한 번씩 끈적끈적한 녹색 액체를 강제로 마시게 했죠. 아주 쓰고... 비린내가 났어요. 하수도 냄새보다도 역겨웠어요.","source_cn":"每隔几天，他都会逼我喝下一罐粘稠的绿色液体，很苦……非...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD79B0D51C52E6251","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1220354017:0":{"text":"그런데 제 흉터가 정말 하루하루 좋아지더니 완전히 사라진 거예요.","source_cn":"但是，我身上的伤疤，竟然真的一天天好了起来，最后完全消失了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x690FD4813E3B4A0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1220354018:0":{"text":"정말 좋은 사람이었던 건가?","source_cn":"难道他是个好人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B3C574EE553DDBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1220354019:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\">그 일</style>이 아니었으면... 저도 좋은 사람이라고 생각했을 거예요.","source_cn":"如果不是发生了<style=stress>那件事</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB81E919B98785496","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1220354020:1":{"text":"그날은 지키는 사람이 없어서 밖으로 도망치려다가 돌에 걸려 발을 다쳤어요.","source_cn":"那天看守都不在，我想逃跑，却不小心被石头砸伤了脚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95C65A42ACE397A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1220354021:0":{"text":"그때 쥐 몇 마리가 기어와 제 상처를 핥았어요. 배가 고파서... 안달이 난 것 같더라고요.","source_cn":"这时候几只老鼠爬过来，舔我的伤口。它们……好像饿疯了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D86BAFA0B7D0A12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1220354022:1":{"text":"혹시... 그때부터 쥐를 조종할 수 있다는 걸 알게 된 거야?","source_cn":"我好像猜到了……是不是从那时候起，你发现自己可以控制老鼠？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36428F8EC493378B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1220354023:0":{"text":"맞아요... 쥐들의 도움으로 그 끔찍한 동굴에서 탈출할 수 있었어요.","source_cn":"是的……在它们的帮助下，我终于逃离了那个可怕的山洞。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89FC8FD7DD4251F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1220354024:1":{"text":"동화 속 공주는 항상 작은 동물의 보호를 받잖아요. 전... 제가 공주가 되는 줄 알았어요.","source_cn":"在故事里，公主不是常常被小动物保护吗？我以为……自己差...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3912686627CE4E94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1220354025:0":{"text":"그런데 러스트 항에 도착하자마자 쥐들이 점점 커지더니... 몬스터가 됐어요.","source_cn":"可是回到锈锚港以后，我发现老鼠们越来越大。它们……变成...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40DC46D4507E2709","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1220354026:1":{"text":"다행히 네가 쥐들을 통제할 수 있어서 더 심각한 일이 일어나진 않은 거구나.","source_cn":"幸好你能够控制这些老鼠，才没有引发更严重的恶果。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x467EDC747D060B38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1220354027:1":{"text":"...아, 아니에요!","source_cn":"——不，不是的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D9FBF970EB91998","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1220354028:0":{"text":"쥐들의 사체를 먹은 동물은 피와 살이 파도처럼 요동치면서 새로운 털이 자라나요... 그러고는 무서운 쥐로 변하죠! 그렇게 변한 녀석들은 제 통제를 전혀 듣지 않아요!","source_cn":"我发现……吃掉那些老鼠尸体的动物，血肉会像海浪一样翻涌...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB20F4643F961A4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1220354029:1":{"text":"네가 마신 그 녹색 액체... 그건 아마 특수한 마법약이었을 거야...","source_cn":"你之前喝下的绿色液体……恐怕是一种特殊的魔药。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB536EC26525372C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1220354030:0":{"text":"어떤 그레이브본들은 생물의 몸을 변화시킬 수 있는 무서운 마법을 다룰 줄 안다고 책에서 봤어... 그게 진짜일 줄은...","source_cn":"书上说，有些亡灵掌握着可怕的魔法，能够改变生物的血肉之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD30259E8D7F17514","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1220354031:0":{"text":"저는 제 상처를 핥으면 통제 불능인 쥐들도 얌전히 제 말을 듣고 다른 사람을 해치지 않을 거라고 생각했어요.","source_cn":"我在想，是不是只要舔了我的伤口，那些老鼠也会乖乖听话，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x521431BF549A2D15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1220354032:0":{"text":"그래서 더 이상 밖에서 소란을 피우지 않길 바라며 제 피를 마시게 했죠.","source_cn":"所以，我尝试给它们喝自己的血，希望它们不要再去地面上作乱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4AE3059B3A3F0A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1220354033:0":{"text":"하지만 쥐들뿐만 아니라... 저도 저 자신을 통제할 수 없게 되었어요!","source_cn":"但是，不止是老鼠……我甚至无法控制我自己！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E22A924A7CE232F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1220354034:0":{"text":"물어뜯고 싶고... 부수고 싶고... 쥐처럼 땅을 기어 다니고 싶어요! 저도 곧 몬스터로 변할 거예요!","source_cn":"想要撕咬……想要破坏……想要趴在地上，像老鼠一样爬行！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26D4D68C411EC208","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1220354035:1":{"text":"마스터가 몬스터로 변하지 않게 도와줄 거야!","source_cn":"有主人在，你不会变成怪物！主人能帮你！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFBC5A57A706ABFF6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터가 몬스터로 변하지 않게 도와줄 거야!","female":"마스터가 몬스터로 변하지 않게 도와줄 거야!","variant_male_record_index":"134475","variant_female_record_index":"134476","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1220354036:1":{"text":"좀 더 빨리 만났다면... 좋았겠지만... 이제는... 너무 늦었어요...","source_cn":"如果……能早一点……但是……现在已经……太迟了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE221A9A13738A59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1220354037:0":{"text":"변하고 있는 게... 느껴져요. 오늘 밤 달이 질 때쯤에, 아니면 내일 태양이 떠오를 때쯤에... 저는 아마...","source_cn":"我能感觉到……变化要来了。也许是今晚月亮落下的时候，也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD85C903EDD0A3DC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1220354038:1":{"text":"다른 사람을 해치고 싶지 않아요... 죽고 나면 듀라 여신의 가호가 내린 땅으로 가고 싶어요...","source_cn":"我不想伤害别人……我想在死后，去艾雅庇护的地方……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3EA3D62B8A06735","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_recor